<div><h3>Klaviyo or Shopify Email for seasonal gifting?</h3><p>Seasonal Gifting beginners do well on native email; Klaviyo fits when seasonal gifting logic leans on events, catalog data, and segment reporting, with profile billing modeled on seasonal gifting expansion.</p></div>
